SARS-CoV-2 Seasonality Manuscript Analyses Overview

This R script contains the full analysis pipeline for a manuscript examining SARS-CoV-2 seasonal transmission dynamics across 10 U.S. states.
It implements a compartmental mechanistic two-tier SEIRS-V model (Susceptible–Exposed–Infectious–Recovered–Vaccinated) ODE system with 10 compartments (S, E, I, 
R, V for each of two immunity tiers) and models hospitalization time series ten US states (GA, MI, MN, NY, OH, TN, CA, CO, OR, UT) and generates all manuscript 
figures. Parameter estimates are fixed from the literature or fitted in prior model calibration procedures. 


